[
    {
        "id": "garden_lights_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "═══════════════ Garden Lights Control (16 Switches) ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Garden Lights Control\n\n**Flow Number:** 320\n\n### Purpose\nControls 16 garden light switches via MQTT.\n\n### Hardware\n- **GardenAutomationLights** (Tasmota) - 12 relays\n- **frontHousePower** (Sonoff Power) - 4 relays\n\n### MQTT Topics\n**GardenAutomationLights (Switches 1-12):**\n- Status: `GardenAutomationLights/STAT/Relay[1-12]`\n- Command: `GardenAutomationLights/CMD/Relay[1-12]`\n\n**frontHousePower (Switches 13-16):**\n- Status: `stat/frontHousePower/POWER[1-4]`\n- Command: `cmnd/frontHousePower/POWER[1-4]`\n\n### Features\n- 16 individual light switches\n- Master ON/OFF buttons (control all lights)\n- Real-time status from MQTT\n- Dashboard 2.0 UI\n\n### UI Components\n- Page: Power Monitoring\n- Group: Garden Lights\n- 16 x ui-switch (individual control)\n- 2 x ui-button (master ON/OFF)\n\n### Dependencies\n- mqtt_broker_local\n- ui_group_garden_lights",
        "x": 270,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
